{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.xinxi.2021a.q12.material.recovered", "text": "韩老师所在学校有一组5000人左右的学生数据，存储于学籍数据库之中，学籍数据以学生姓名为关键字升序排列存储。韩老师请学生完成以下学习任务：通过编写程序设计一个查询系统，实现当输入学生姓名时能够显示正确的学生学籍数据的功能。为此，韩老师设计了如下表所示的评价表。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "e642cece7770379a4799ea2c85734893493de2bf22cfc6f51a37d56795fd34e4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2391, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2521, "next_source_question_number": 20, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 12, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "e642cece7770379a4799ea2c85734893493de2bf22cfc6f51a37d56795fd34e4"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.xinxi.2021a.q12"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.xinxi.s1.k03", "ntce.gaozhong.xinxi.s1.k05", "ntce.gaozhong.xinxi.s1.k10"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.415.r001", "ntce.outline.415.r006", "ntce.outline.415.r009", "ntce.outline.415.r010"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.xinxi.2021a.q12"], "word_count": 130, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "xinxi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中信息技术》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "e642cece7770379a4799ea2c85734893493de2bf22cfc6f51a37d56795fd34e4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2391, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2521, "next_source_question_number": 20, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2021年上半年教师资格证考试《高中信息技术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 12, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "e642cece7770379a4799ea